      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "using System.Linq;\r\n\r\nList\u003Cint\u003E numbers = new List\u003Cint\u003E(100);\r\nRandom random = new();\r\nfor(int i = 0; i \u003C 100;i\u002B\u002B)\r\n{\r\n    numbers.Add(random.Next(0,1000));\r\n}\r\n\r\nnumbers",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
